@startuml
title Sequence Diagram 01 - Booking Overview

actor "Customer" as Customer
participant "Web / Mobile Client" as Client
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Event Catalog Service" as Catalog
participant "Reservation Service" as Reservation
participant "Payment Service" as Payment
participant "Ticket Service" as Ticket
participant "Notification Service" as Notification

Customer -> Client: Search event and select seat
Client -> Gateway: Send booking request
Gateway -> Catalog: Get event and seat information
Catalog --> Gateway: Return event details

Gateway -> Reservation: Create temporary reservation
Reservation --> Gateway: Reservation created

Gateway -> Payment: Start checkout process
Payment --> Gateway: Payment session created

Gateway -> Ticket: Generate ticket after payment success
Ticket --> Gateway: Ticket generated

Gateway -> Notification: Send confirmation notification
Notification --> Gateway: Notification queued

Gateway --> Client: Show booking result
Client --> Customer: Display ticket information

@enduml
